          "content": "**Triage Bot \u2014 SLO Overview.** Owned by the triage-bot app; alerts route ONLY to **#triage-bot-health**. Rules live in *Triage Bot / SLO*. Runbooks: `references/architecture/alerting-system-design.md`."
